{
    "theme": "尋找物品",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "ina, kadruwan a nirumaenan druwa i ruma garem i!",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924886",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "puwaruma i bau na mainayan an uninan. driyama, kadruwan a trau druwa.",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924887",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "iuwa ta dra semangal i! paetreng ta lla adri menau kanadru.",
                "textCh": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924888",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "aiwa! kabangabang ta an uninan. pullang lla kikarun maw!",
                "textCh": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924889",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "emdaamaw! malladram ku lla.",
                "textCh": "好的，我一定會！(當然！我知道了。)",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924890",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "auka ku penadanga kana pamamanayan na manay driya an garemay.",
                "textCh": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924891",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "kayku pullanga!",
                "textCh": "我來幫忙！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924892",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "aiwa, kurenang kanku!",
                "textCh": "好，你跟我來！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66305/924893",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            }
        ],
        "phase2": {
